{"title":"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 16","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/a/eeafb4cc408694d4635cf4cc487287cfbb950156.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1990-1980+1970-1960+\\cdots -20+10 =$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"355\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/1/0f12a3bb3d3294ce69c7e4a99a48cb92bbf484b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ -990 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ -10 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 990 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 1000 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 1990$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"474\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>This sum has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/2/c72d785aaa889766010b76799bcc40c0548c8807.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1990}{10} = 199$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"94\" height=\"38\" /> terms.  Grouping the sum as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/4/974c0902c197b85c04b96a7c2c015b8ed4a58511.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1990-1980)+(1970-1960)+...+(30-20)+10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"415\" height=\"20\" /> creates <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/6/5f6179d959c05a96e95c74759311623f358be593.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{198}{2} + 1 = 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"116\" height=\"38\" /> groups which each sum to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, so the total sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/7/9e7070c0b8671903c495a21db5bf6d05a180f14b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100\\cdot 10 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 1000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"167\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>As in Solution 1, this sum has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/3/0f31ff033089cb9cfa5a6ce6cd9a0ce6b5c57422.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$199$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> terms.  Grouping the sum as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/3/bf366f50facf0c201feb432a1efaa18ee2ecb8f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1990 + (-1980+1970) + (-1960+1950) + ... + (-20+10)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"476\" height=\"20\" /> creates <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/a/2da25842e5bc5cea4ea0655d05934e7ac6bf47ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{198}{2} = 99$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"76\" height=\"38\" /> groups which each sum to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/7/d7701e9469f26e22c106341791344b28f3196443.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"31\" height=\"13\" />, so the total sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/b/32b37d942dce4ef54d7d578996d2057276bcb781.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1990 + (99)(-10) = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 1000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"246\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Grouping the terms as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/a/92ad0c6c06b3dbe078fef8bf25db3b1a62c4ebb2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1990 + 10) - (1980 + 20) + ... + (1030 + 970) - (1020 + 980) + (1010 + 990) - 1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"668\" height=\"20\" /> shows that the sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/6/9969a7aaa1c18ffb634dac62eac7ade3d5de49cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2000 - 2000) + ... + (2000 - 2000) + 2000 - 10000 = 0 + ... + 0 + 1000 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 1000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"673\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME\" title=\"1990 AJHSME\">1990 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1990\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_8_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 8 Problems and Solutions\"> All AJHSME/AMC 8 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017182100\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.026 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.039 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 133/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1967/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 132/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2965/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.128      1 Template:AJHSME_box\n100.00%    7.128      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:8252:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017182100 and revision id 290586. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}